  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Luo Ran activates suppress space Immortal Gu when a formation of Heavenly Court tries to teleport another Southern Alliance Gu Immortal away. Its power spreads out and the surrounding space freezes instantly like ice, and the Southern Alliance immortals feel a strong restrictive force, as if sealed in an ice coffin. A rank seven Immortal Gu cannot deal with the formation, but this one gives the Southern Alliance Gu Immortal a few crucial seconds to escape. Luo Ran dispels the effect afterward and the immortals feel the pressure lift. He says he obtained the Gu from an Earth Trench recently, and that its range is wide and cannot be controlled. Chi Qu You calls it a good Gu worm that counters the formation, and with it the Southern Alliance immortals no longer have concerns when moving in the formation space.",
        "chapters": [
          1709
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "fac_heavenly_court",
          "fac_southern_alliance",
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "reg_earth_earth_trench",
          "char_chi_qu_you",
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan activates suppress space Immortal Gu against Feng Jiu Ge, who has just decided to use Fixed Immortal Travel. This Gu was obtained from the diamond head turtle when Fang Yuan specially went to Southern Border’s Earth Trench. Suppress space Immortal Gu can prevent the use of any space path methods within a certain area, and because it is also rank seven it counters the rank seven Fixed Immortal Travel. Feng Jiu Ge is shocked at how thoroughly Fang Yuan has prepared, and Fang Yuan then steals Fixed Immortal Travel from him with great thief ghost hand.",
        "chapters": [
          1760
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "counter-to-fixed-immortal-travel",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_feng_jiu_ge",
          "gu_fixed_immortal_travel",
          "reg_southern_border"
        ]
      },
      {
