        "section": "counter-to-fixed-immortal-travel",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After rebirth, Fang Yuan has two most likely choices against Fixed Immortal Travel, fixed space Immortal Gu and suppress space Immortal Gu. In his previous life a Luo clan Gu Immortal, Luo Ran, obtained suppress space Immortal Gu, and when Wu Yong led the Southern Alliance Gu Immortals against the nine-nine consecutive unceasing formation, Luo Ran used it and achieved great success. According to information from that previous life, it is easily obtainable.",
        "chapters": [
          1760
        ],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "counter-to-fixed-immortal-travel",
