          "char_wu_yong"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Feng Jiu Ge later recalls his fight against Fang Yuan in the second invasion of Lang Ya blessed land, where Fang Yuan’s prepared suppress space Immortal Gu stopped his escape by Fixed Immortal Travel.",
